\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 In this project, I explored the relationship between perspective, focal length/zoom, and the center of projection! The first one is how \
\
Every camera makes two decisions at once: how far it stands from the world, and how much it magnifies what it sees. Change them together and a photo can stay the same size but tell a completely different story about depth. The three experiments below isolate that relationship \'97 first on a face, then on a building, then in one continuous move known as the dolly zoom.\
